### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Create enquiry - pricing
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "John Doe",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "message": "Can you share pricing for 10 users?"
}

### Create enquiry - unmatched (should auto-escalate via worker)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Ava",
  "channel": "email",
  "message": "I need details about your office wallpaper colors."
}

### Create enquiry - invalid channel (422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Bad Channel",
  "channel": "sms",
  "message": "hello"
}

### Schedule follow-up for open enquiry (replace id)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1/follow-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delay_minutes": 45,
  "message_template": "Following up on your enquiry."
}

### Schedule follow-up with invalid delay (422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1/follow-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delay_minutes": 0,
  "message_template": "Invalid delay."
}

### Manual escalation for open enquiry (replace id)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer requested live support."
}

### Escalation reason too short (422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "x"
}

### History timeline (replace id)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/enquiry/1/history
